Z||000000||ezsurf||11-08-2000||11:51 AM||||I'm trying to find out the intake/exhaust valve sizes on the V-6 heads.  I'm plugging these numbers into some dyno software to see what changes will make a difference.  There has to be a technical site somewhere with this info on it.  Although, I don't know which one.  On an old forum post someone sent me a resistance chart for a temp sensor (a certain resistance at a certain temperature).  I don't know which site this info came from, but I'm sure it has other technical info that I could use as well.  The Pontiac manual just isn't detailed enough.  Anybody know where to find this?||||reg||5
